{"seq":2,"slug":"censoring-truncation","title":"删失与截断","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/censoring-truncation","wordCount":1682,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"删失与截断\">删失与截断</h1><p>研究一项新药，你招募了 200 名患者，跟踪三年。三年到期时，130 人去世（你知道确切的死亡时间），50 人还活着（你只知道他们「至少活了三年」），还有 20 人中途搬走联系不上（你只知道他们「失访前一直活着」）。这 70 个没有确切事件时间的样本，正是生存分析数据的灵魂所在。如何对待它们，决定了你的估计是无偏还是错得离谱。这一篇把不完整观测的两大类——删失（censoring）与截断（truncation）——彻底讲清，它们是全 hub 反复引用却只在此处展开的概念。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>删失与截断都源于「观测不完整」，但机制完全不同，初学者极易混淆。一句话区分：删失是「这个个体在样本里，但它的事件时间没被完整看到」；截断是「某些个体因为观测机制根本没机会进入样本」。前者是部分信息缺失，后者是选择性进入。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[观测不完整] --&gt; B[删失 censoring&lt;br/&gt;个体在样本中&lt;br/&gt;事件时间未完整观测]&#10;  A --&gt; C[截断 truncation&lt;br/&gt;个体能否进入样本&lt;br/&gt;本身受时间条件约束]&#10;  B --&gt; B1[右删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 大于 c]&#10;  B --&gt; B2[左删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 小于 c]&#10;  B --&gt; B3[区间删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 落在某区间]&#10;  C --&gt; C1[左截断&lt;br/&gt;延迟进入风险集]&#10;  C --&gt; C2[右截断&lt;br/&gt;只观测到已发生事件者]\">flowchart TD\n  A[观测不完整] --&gt; B[删失 censoring&lt;br/&gt;个体在样本中&lt;br/&gt;事件时间未完整观测]\n  A --&gt; C[截断 truncation&lt;br/&gt;个体能否进入样本&lt;br/&gt;本身受时间条件约束]\n  B --&gt; B1[右删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 大于 c]\n  B --&gt; B2[左删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 小于 c]\n  B --&gt; B3[区间删失&lt;br/&gt;只知 T 落在某区间]\n  C --&gt; C1[左截断&lt;br/&gt;延迟进入风险集]\n  C --&gt; C2[右截断&lt;br/&gt;只观测到已发生事件者]</pre><p>下表是这一篇的速查总纲，后面各节逐一展开。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>你知道什么</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>右删失</td>\n<td>随访结束/失访时事件未发生</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &gt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>研究截止时仍存活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左删失</td>\n<td>首次观测时事件已发生</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>体检发现已感染，不知何时感染</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>区间删失</td>\n<td>两次检查之间发生</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\in (l, r]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>复查间隔内复发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左截断</td>\n<td>延迟进入风险集</td>\n<td>进入前的样本不可见</td>\n<td>队列研究中年龄起算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>右截断</td>\n<td>只采样到已发生事件者</td>\n<td>未发生者不在样本</td>\n<td>仅从死亡登记回溯</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"右删失-最常见的一种\">右删失：最常见的一种</h2><p>右删失占据了生存分析数据的绝大多数。它的含义是：到观测结束时，关注的事件还没有发生，你只能断言「真实事件时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 大于某个删失时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>」。新药研究里活到三年还健在的 50 人、还没失访就到期的患者，都是右删失。</p>\n<p>右删失又细分三种来源。第一种是行政删失（administrative censoring）：研究有固定截止日期，到期未发事件的样本被统一删失——这种删失时间通常与生存时间独立，最干净。第二种是失访（loss to follow-up）：患者搬家、退出研究，删失时间随机出现。第三种是竞争事件导致的删失，但这种处理要格外小心，简单当成右删失会有偏，正确做法见 <a href=\"../practice/competing-risks\">竞争风险</a>。</p>\n<p>在数据表里，右删失通常用一个事件指示变量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 编码：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示观测到事件，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 表示右删失。每个样本记录一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(T_i, \\delta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，这是几乎所有生存模型的标准输入格式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"左删失与区间删失\">左删失与区间删失</h2><p>左删失发生在「首次观测时事件已经发生，但不知道具体何时」。经典例子：一项 HIV 研究在某时刻给受试者做检测，部分人已经阳性——你知道感染时间早于检测日（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T &lt; c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>），却无法定位。儿童发育研究里，第一次观测时孩子已会某项技能，也是左删失。</p>\n<p>区间删失则更普遍但常被忽视。当事件只能在离散的复查点被发现时，你只知道它落在「上次正常」和「这次异常」两个检查之间，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T \\in (l, r]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。定期体检发现的肿瘤复发、定期巡检发现的设备劣化，本质都是区间删失。把区间删失草率地当成右删失（取区间右端为事件时间）会高估生存时间，专门的区间删失似然或多重插补才是正解。</p>\n<p>实务上，右删失的工具链最成熟（<a href=\"../nonparametric/kaplan-meier\">Kaplan-Meier 估计</a> 与 <a href=\"../models/cox-proportional-hazards\">Cox 比例风险模型</a> 默认就处理右删失），左删失与区间删失则需要专门方法，lifelines 提供了 <code>LogNormalFitter</code> 等可拟合区间删失的参数模型。</p>\n<h2 id=\"截断-另一种偏倚来源\">截断：另一种偏倚来源</h2><p>截断和删失最大的区别是：删失的个体仍在你的数据集中（只是信息不全），而截断的个体根本没机会被采样。忽视截断会造成隐蔽且严重的偏倚。</p>\n<p>左截断（left truncation）最常见，又叫延迟进入（delayed entry）。设想一项以「年龄」为时间轴的研究，受试者在 60 岁入组——那些 60 岁前就去世的人永远不会出现在你的样本里。如果直接用 Kaplan-Meier 从 0 岁起算，会严重高估早期生存。正确做法是为每个样本指定一个进入时间，让它只在「进入之后」才计入风险集。这种「延迟进入风险集」的处理，与时变协变量共用同一套计数过程数据格式，详见 <a href=\"../practice/time-varying-covariates\">时变协变量</a>。</p>\n<p>右截断（right truncation）较少见，典型出现在「只能从已发生事件回溯采样」的场景，例如仅通过死亡登记册研究某病——还活着的人不在册子里，导致样本偏向短生存者。处理右截断需要专门的逆向似然，远比左截断棘手。</p>\n<h2 id=\"删失独立性-那个沉默的假设\">删失独立性：那个沉默的假设</h2><p>几乎所有标准生存方法都暗含一个关键假设：删失与事件相互独立（independent / non-informative censoring）。直白地说，一个样本在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 时刻被删失，不应该携带「它即将发生事件」的信息。行政删失天然满足；但如果病人因为病情恶化而退出研究（失访），删失就携带了风险信息，这叫信息性删失（informative censoring），会让估计偏向乐观。</p>\n<p>这个假设无法用数据直接检验，只能靠对采集机制的理解来辩护。它是生存分析里最容易被遗忘、却最常导致结论错误的前提之一，相关的诊断与规避手段见 <a href=\"../practice/pitfalls-validation\">陷阱与验证</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>删失：个体在样本中但事件时间未完整观测——右删失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T&gt;c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>，最常见）、左删失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T&lt;c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>）、区间删失（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>l</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T\\in(l,r]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li>截断：个体能否进入样本本身受时间约束——左截断（延迟进入）、右截断（只采样到已发生者）。</li>\n<li>删失 vs 截断核心区别：删失的样本仍在数据里，截断的样本根本没机会被采样。</li>\n<li>标准数据格式用一对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(T_i,\\delta_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 编码右删失；左截断需额外的进入时间。</li>\n<li>删失独立性假设是绝大多数方法的隐性前提，信息性删失会让结论偏乐观，且无法用数据直接检验。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"删失与截断","id":"删失与截断"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"右删失：最常见的一种","id":"右删失-最常见的一种"},{"level":2,"text":"左删失与区间删失","id":"左删失与区间删失"},{"level":2,"text":"截断：另一种偏倚来源","id":"截断-另一种偏倚来源"},{"level":2,"text":"删失独立性：那个沉默的假设","id":"删失独立性-那个沉默的假设"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"什么是生存分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/what-is-survival-analysis"},"next":{"title":"生存与风险函数","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/survival-analysis/foundations/survival-hazard-functions"}}